# FWCCA Simulation Code

This directory contains the MATLAB code used for the simulation studies in

**Feature-Weighted Canonical Correlation Analysis for Spatial fMRI**.

The simulation code is organized into two main parts:

1. `01_MainSimulation/` reproduces the main simulation study reported in
   Section 5.1 of the manuscript, including the illustrative example, the
   500-replicate Monte Carlo simulation, bandwidth selection, and the
   corresponding manuscript and supplementary figures.

2. `02_z0SensitivityAnalysis/` reproduces the sensitivity analysis
   investigating the effect of four different initial activation indicators
   $begin:math:text$z\_0$end:math:text$, as reported in Section 5.1.2 of the manuscript.

Shared MATLAB functions are stored in `Functions/`. Functions used specifically
for constructing and evaluating the different $begin:math:text$z\_0$end:math:text$ initialization strategies
are implemented in the MATLAB package `+z0sensitivity/`.


