The evaluation includes:

- normalized mean canonical spatial maps;
- bandwidth selection based on training and testing AUC and local spatial
  variance;
- testing AUC across SNR levels;
- distributions of test explained variation (EV);
- distributions of test absolute reconstruction correlation (`|RCOR|`).

